# Build context for Dockerfile.replay-go only (the other Dockerfiles have no ignore file):
# the Go module and nothing else, without local build output (the binary names .gitignore
# keeps out of the tree: swath, swath-<os>-<arch>, swath-replay, swath-replay-<os>-<arch>).
*
!go/
go/swath
go/swath-*
go/swath.exe
